{
  "id": "ssh.passwordless.disable",
  "version": 1,
  "side": "controller",
  "title": { "zh": "撤销 SSH 免密登录", "en": "Disable SSH passwordless login" },
  "summary": "移除 authorized_keys 里由本工具写入的那一行、删除本地专用密钥，并切回密码认证",
  "risk": "R3",
  "params": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "passwordRef": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "切回密码认证时使用的凭据引用（默认沿用目标原有引用）"
      }
    },
    "additionalProperties": false
  },
  "requires": { "root": false, "distros": [], "binaries": [] },
  "idempotent": true,
  "timeoutMs": 60000,
  "check": { "probe": "ssh.pubkeyState" },
  "apply": {
    "default": { "handler": "auth.passwordless.disable" }
  },
  "verify": { "probe": "ssh.pubkeyState", "expect": { "serviceKeyInstalled": false } },
  "notes": [
    "controller 侧动作（在主控端本地执行），不产生远端 argv",
    "与启用对称的事务：**先用密码另开一条连接验证成功，才移除密钥** —— 否则若服务端已禁用密码认证，移除后你将无法登录",
    "远端已禁用密码认证时**拒绝撤销**并说明原因"
  ]
}
